        <mxCell id="Qk9Qh86WJIAYJ9Z8XEue-27" value="&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Forward APIKEY to Bearer Token exchange requests to IAM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400; background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;1. if POST and url path = /api/iam/token Forward to IAM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;2. If not bearer token request follow standard flow to validate cert and token match&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=5;spacingTop=-20;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" parent="Qk9Qh86WJIAYJ9Z8XEue-1" vertex="1">
