        <mxCell id="fvv0S7Gdkh-mr2_CQ6a0-34" value="&lt;h1&gt;API to Bearer Token Steps&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;The APIKEY is matched up, validating that it is a valid API key.&amp;nbsp; The certificate ID associated with the API key is used to lookup the correct certificate info(rmation) record for step B.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Certificate Info document contains the certificate fingerprint.&amp;nbsp; This is used to.validate against the incoming header from the load balancer.&amp;nbsp; The header must contain a certifcate fingerpring from the load balancer AND this must match the certificate for this customer set for this APIKEY in order to be accepted.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;The bearer token that is generated includes in its payload the certificate fingerprint enabling the API gateway to validate all incoming API calls against the proper client certificate for this bearer token and avoiding the API gateway needing to do any lookups as all material needed for validation is either in the bearer token passed in the API call or is passed in as a header based on the client certificate presented to the load balancer by the caller.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=5;spacingTop=-20;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" parent="Qk9Qh86WJIAYJ9Z8XEue-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="160" y="1800" width="830" height="230" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="fvv0S7Gdkh-mr2_CQ6a0-35" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;A&lt;/font&gt;" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=2;" parent="Qk9Qh86WJIAYJ9Z8XEue-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="110" y="1850" width="35" height="35" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="fvv0S7Gdkh-mr2_CQ6a0-36" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;B&lt;/font&gt;" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=2;" parent="Qk9Qh86WJIAYJ9Z8XEue-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="110" y="1920" width="35" height="35" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="fvv0S7Gdkh-mr2_CQ6a0-37" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;C&lt;/font&gt;" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=2;" parent="Qk9Qh86WJIAYJ9Z8XEue-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="110" y="1998" width="35" height="35" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
