        <mxCell id="8ZJvOG1FZV36GMm8jSOF-14" value="&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Ensure only Client (A) can interact with Client (A)&#39;s accounts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;1. Validate Bearer Token is signed properly and is signed by our JWT cert&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;2. Extract cert_sha256_fingerprint from bearer token&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;3. Ensure customer cert_sha256 in bearer token and in header match&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;4. Reject any call that does not match&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=5;spacingTop=-20;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="840" y="300" width="510" height="220" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
